  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Elvis Duarte",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:06:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:06:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. Let me explain. I'm calling for my mother at 94 Chapel Street, up on the Hill. Her old couch is going out, and I want to know how to put out a bulk item like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a couch at 94 Chapel Street. Is it for the regular trash pickup day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:06:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Sorry, hold on. [pause] My son is doing homework here at the kitchen table, so I'm on speaker. Can you hear me alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:07:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. So you need a bulk pickup for the couch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:07:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And the other thing, her trash bin cracked in the storm last weekend, the nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. How do I request a replacement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:07:19-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take that request now. A replacement bin for 94 Chapel Street, cracked from the storm. And for the couch, I'll note it and have someone call you with the pickup steps. Is 401-555-0159 the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:07:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:07:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
